  <!-- EN: medieval double bed -->
  <sd_medieval_double_bed.label>中世纪双人床</sd_medieval_double_bed.label>
  <!-- EN: A comfy bed with fur. Fits two. One of the famous hunters of the Rimworlds came up with this bed design after claiming his 100th Thrumbo kill. In the attemp to display his pride he developed this bed. His ingenuity in bed building spread faster than the words from his big game hunt. His name was forgotten. But after years his beds live on showing the pride of hunters all over the Rimworlds. -->
  <sd_medieval_double_bed.description>一张铺着毛皮的舒适床铺。可容纳两人。边境世界的一位著名猎人在猎杀第100只瑟姆博后，设计出了这款床。为了彰显自己的骄傲，他研发了这张床。他在制床方面的巧思传播得比他猎杀大型野兽的传奇还要快。他的名字早已被遗忘。 但多年过去，他的床依然流传至今，彰显着整个RimWorlds各地猎人们的骄傲。</sd_medieval_double_bed.description>
